	"system": {
		"description": "<p>You gain tremorsense out to a range of 15 feet. If you spend your turn without moving, your tremorsense extends out to a range of 30 feet. If you use any movement or are forcibly moved (such as being shoved or by the thunderwave spell), your tremorsense reverts back to 15 feet until you spend another turn without moving.</p>",
